            "review_title": "Review at Yes Chef Kitchen & More",
            "review_text": "Ritz Pham\nNha Trang, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nBest Fusion Style Restaurant in Nha Trang\nJan 2022 • Friends\nWhat a lovely dinner in the beautiful garden with friends. Outstanding GRILLED PEPPER RIBEYE; flavourful fusion style Teriyaki Pork Rib; and many more plates that out of my expectations.\nIt would be more accessible if the restaurant was located in the city center, but it shouldn't be difficult for you to drive here to enjoy their menu and atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2022\nKelvin Huynh\nHi Mr Ritzpham1109\n\nThank you for your review. Yes Chef is happy to make you satisfied. Hope Yes Chef will bring you many other great experiences in the next time. Look forward to seeing you soon!\n\nBest regards,\nGM & Ex.Chef Loc Huynh \nCall: 0335896807\nEmail: lochuynh.exchefyeschefnhatrang@gmail.com\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
